":[""],"widgets_values_named":{"value":""},"color":"#33b733","bgcolor":"#1fa31f"},{"id":74,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-1550,1700],"size":[690,700],"flags":{"pinned":true},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Model Links","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.7","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["# Flux2 Series Workflow Model Summary\n\n## Workflows\n\n-  **[Flux2_Image_Edit.json](https://github.com/renvder/local-ai-toolkit/blob/main/ComfyUI/Workflows/Flux2_Image_Edit.json)**\n    - **Functionality:** Prompt Combination & Style Editing. Combines separate textual parameters (like \"Perspective,\" \"Lighting,\" and \"Style\") using multiple `PrimitiveStringMultiline` nodes to generate a single, complex, and highly descriptive composite prompt.\n    - **Unique Needs:** Focuses on advanced textual prompt construction capability.\n\n## Models Required for All Workflows\n\nThis Flux2 workflow series requires multiple versions and components depending on model size and specific task (9B vs 4B).\n\n- **Diffusion Model (Unet):**\n    - `flux-2-klein-9b-fp8.safetensors` (9B Model, for complex editing, e.g., Dual-Edit)\n    \n- **Text Encoder (CLIP):**\n    - `qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors` (For 9B model)\n    \n- **VAE:**\n    - `flux2-vae.safetensors` (For image encoding/decoding)\n\nThese models must be downloaded and placed in the `ComfyUI/models/` directory before launching any workflow.\n\n## Download Links and Path Details\n\n| Type | Filename | Model page / direct download | Target folder |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Diffusion model (9B) | `flux-2-klein-9b-fp8.safetensors` | [Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-9b-fp8/tree/main) | `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/flux2-klein-9b-fp8.safetensors` |\n| Text Encoder (9B) | `qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors` | [Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-klein-9B/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors) | `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors` |\n| VAE | `flux2-vae.safetensors` | [Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/VAST-AI/TripoSplat/resolve/main/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors) | `ComfyUI/models/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors` |\n\n## Directory Structure\n\n```text\nComfyUI/\n├── models/\n│   └── diffusion_models/\n│       └── flux-2-klein-9b-fp8.safetensors\n│   ├── text_encoders/\n│   │   └── qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors\n│   └── vae/\n│       └── flux2-vae.safetensors"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"# Flux2 Series Workflow Model Summary\n\n## Workflows\n\n-  **[Flux2_Image_Edit.json](https://github.com/renvder/local-ai-toolkit/blob/main/ComfyUI/Workflows/Flux2_Image_Edit.json)**\n    - **Functionality:** Prompt Combination & Style Editing. Combines separate textual parameters (like \"Perspective,\" \"Lighting,\" and \"Style\") using multiple `PrimitiveStringMultiline` nodes to generate a single, complex, and highly descriptive composite prompt.\n    - **Unique Needs:** Focuses on advanced textual prompt construction capability.\n\n## Models Required for All Workflows\n\nThis Flux2 workflow series requires multiple versions and components depending on model size and specific task (9B vs 4B).\n\n- **Diffusion Model (Unet):**\n    - `flux-2-klein-9b-fp8.safetensors` (9B Model, for complex editing, e.g., Dual-Edit)\n    \n- **Text Encoder (CLIP):**\n    - `qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors` (For 9B model)\n    \n- **VAE:**\n    - `flux2-vae.safetensors` (For image encoding/decoding)\n\nThese models must be downloaded and placed in the `ComfyUI/models/` directory before launching any workflow.\n\n## Download Links and Path Details\n\n| Type | Filename | Model page / direct download | Target folder |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Diffusion model (9B) | `flux-2-klein-9b-fp8.safetensors` | [Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-9b-fp8/tree/main) | `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/flux2-klein-9b-fp8.safetensors` |\n| Text Encoder (9B) | `qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors` | [Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-klein-9B/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors) | `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors` |\n| VAE | `flux2-vae.safetensors` | [Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/VAST-AI/TripoSplat/resolve/main/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors) | `ComfyUI/models/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors` |\n\n## Directory Structure\n\n```text\nComfyUI/\n├── models/\n│   └── diffusion_models/\n│       └── flux-2-klein-9b-fp8.safetensors\n│   ├── text_encoders/\n│   │   └── qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors\n│   └── vae/\n│       └── flux2-vae.safetensors"},"color":"#645170","bgcolor":"#503d5c"}],"links":[[54,8,0,39,0,"STRING"],[55,16,0,39,1,"STRING"],[56,18,0,39,2,"STRING"],[57,9,0,39,3,"STRING"],[58,39,0,33,0,"STRING"],[134,31,0,69,9,"STRING"],[135,30,0,69,10,"STRING"],[136,33,0,69,11,"STRING"],[138,68,0,69,0,"INT"],[139,69,0,15,0,"IMAGE"],[149,72,0,69,8,"IMAGE"]],"groups":[{"id":2,"title":"Effect","bounding":[-470,1670,530,730],"color":"#00ff04","flags":{"pinned":true}},{"id":3,"title":"Photo-Restoration","bounding":[-820,1670,340,210],"color":"#00ff04","flags":{"pinned":true}},{"id":4,"title":"Custom-Edit","bounding":[-820,1890,340,510],"color":"#00ff04","flags":{"pinned":true}}],"definitions":{"subgraphs":[{"id":"e1bf3eb1-2b00-4200-aba3-987bfee47b40","version":1,"state":{"lastGroupId":4,"lastNodeId":74,"lastLinkId":151,"lastRerouteId":0},"revision":0,"config":{},"name":"New Subgraph","inputNode":{"id":-10,"bounding":[177,3424,128,308]},"outputNode":{"id":-20,"bounding":[1325,3474,128,68]},"inputs":[{"id":"fa0d1246-a4eb-469b-b101-18e6ff080cfa","name":"seed","type":"INT","linkIds":[148],"localized_name":"seed","pos":[281,3448]},{"id":"f6fe2a40-74cc-44ea-aaeb-16eacc3bdae0","name":"width","type":"INT","linkIds":[141],"pos":[281,3468]},{"id":"fa6d16b1-5e28-46f8-9c99-4ec13fe7c4b3","name":"height","type":"INT","linkIds":[142],"pos":[2